        "created_at": "2013-06-16T14:42:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think you read that wrong. It's saying, if you put that 2nd limited into play, then it would get burned. From my understanding, the card was not considered limited before it entered play (which allows you to play it in the first place), then after its in play its now considered a duplicate limited and discarded</p>",
