        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-16T16:51:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't think the Take Down thing matters - the card is entering play. It doesn't have text yet. The Informant triggers and the villain deck plays a card. That done, and assuming nothing else acts on the same trigger, you then look at the played card because its text now becomes active. Oh, look, it's Take Down - okay, the bad guys can't play any more cards now, and Legacy has to take some damage.</p>",
