      {
        "id": 65798,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-18T20:37:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, I just go by what I read on the forum a while back - if something reacts to a card being played, it does so before said card's text activates. Therefore it doesn't matter what that card is, so I don't bother looking at it...unless it's a hero card, of course, in which case it's unavoidable and I just go \"I'm playing this card, so I get interrupted by...\" and do the triggered reaction (Informant, for example).</p>",
